1
00:00:00,711 --> 00:00:05,261
No. When I eat Froot Loops,
the other astronauts make fun of me!

2
00:00:08,719 --> 00:00:11,309
I don't wanna wait
until you're back to get married.

3
00:00:11,513 --> 00:00:12,683
(Howard:)What?

4
00:00:12,890 --> 00:00:15,640
l wanna be married to you
before you get in that rocket.

5
00:00:16,018 --> 00:00:18,308
(Howard:)But I'm leaving in two days.

6
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:21,310
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)What about Apple Jacks?

7
00:00:22,232 --> 00:00:24,862
I don't need to take cereal!

8
00:00:25,069 --> 00:00:27,109
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)What kind of breakfast do you think...

9
00:00:27,321 --> 00:00:29,241
...they're gonna give you in Russia?

10
00:00:34,328 --> 00:00:36,618
(Howard:)They invented
the light bulb in New Jersey!

11
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:40,580
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)It doesn't mean they hand them out
to you when you go!

12
00:00:42,086 --> 00:00:44,546
We'll have a little ceremony
with just our friends.

13
00:00:44,755 --> 00:00:48,005
(Bernadette:)We'll still have the big reception
with everyone when you get back.

14
00:00:48,217 --> 00:00:50,717
(Howard:)Wow, okay, let's get married.

15
00:00:55,808 --> 00:00:57,018
You know what?

16
00:00:57,226 --> 00:01:05,026
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)I'll buy you All-Bran in case
you get stopped up in outer space!

